{"date": "2026-10-30", "word": "Flat", "summary": "A flat day (forecast flat). Thermals stayed light all day. The upslope ran from about 08:30 to about 16:15. A low day for October: the base stayed down near 3,300 ft (normal 4,500\u20135,400 ft). The evening before, the page called it normal, about 4,000 ft, a miss. Midday the base averaged about 3,300 ft by the Kekoa camera, 700 ft lower than the evening's number; the morning update said about 4,000 ft, off by 700 ft. Most of the day the shear line was crossing Kula Highway near Omaopio; furthest north about 10:40, at Pukalani. Data gaps: no readings all day from 1 station (Nakula); Kamehamenui 1 stopped at 15:48; Kula 1 stopped at 15:48; the Mesonet could not be reached on 13 of 57 updates.", "therm": "<strong>Flat</strong> for the day, 10:00\u201314:00<div class=\"sub\">Kula Ag's measured air through the NAM sounding (thermal.py); forecast was Flat</div>", "base": "", "notes": [], "chart": "<div style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:.9rem;margin:10px 0 2px\">Cloudbase, derived</div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:.8rem;color:var(--muted,#6b6b66);margin:2px 0 4px\">\n\n<span><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:16px;height:2px;background:#2a78d6;vertical-align:middle\"></span> Derived (stations)</span><span><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:#3f9d5a;vertical-align:middle\"></span> Kekoa camera</span><span><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:#e0a100;vertical-align:middle\"></span> Camera hidden (cloud or rain)</span><span><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;border:1.5px solid #898781;box-sizing:border-box;vertical-align:middle\"></span> Camera, no call</span></div>\n<div style=\"position:relative;width:100%;min-width:0;height:220px\"><canvas id=\"basechart\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Derived cloudbase through the day\"></canvas></div>\n<div class=\"sub\